```Title: Suspicious Scheduled Task Creation via schtasks (raw Sysmon events)```
```ATT&CK: T1053.005 | Severity: medium | Sigma id: e0ef03a7-1b14-406e-8caa-7064d070cac1```
```Data source: Sysmon EventCode 1 (Splunk Add-on for Sysmon). Change index to where your Sysmon data lives.```
```False positives: Software installers and updaters creating scheduled tasks; Admin automation```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity medium.```
index=sysmon source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
(Image="*\\schtasks.exe" CommandLine="* /create *" CommandLine IN ("*/ru system*", "*/sc onlogon*", "*/sc onstart*", "*\\Users\\Public\\*", "*\\AppData\\*", "*\\Temp\\*", "*powershell*", "*wscript*", "*mshta*"))
| table _time host User ParentImage Image CommandLine
